 python3,
 xdg-utils,
Description: browser-based Micropolis Core city simulation
 Micropolis is the open-source release of the classic city simulation
 engine, presented as a self-contained local web application.
 .
 This package serves the bundled application over loopback HTTP and opens
 it in the user's default browser. No external web service is required to
 load or run the packaged game.
